  "title": "Cardcaptor Sakura",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 70668 and TMDB show 35790. AniDB episode 36-46 (\"さくらと雪の新学期\" (Sakura and the Snowy New School Term) to \"さくらと最後の審判\" (Sakura and the Final Judgement)) are TMDB S2E1 \"さくらと雪の新学期\" (Sakura and the Snowy New School Year) to TMDB S2E11 \"さくらと最後の審判\" (Sakura and the Final Judgment); AniDB episode 47-70 (\"さくらと不思議な転校生\" (Sakura and the Mysterious Transfer Student) to \"さくらと本当の想い\" (Sakura and Her True Feeling)) are TMDB S3E1 \"さくらと不思議な転校生\" (Sakura and the Mysterious Transfer Student) to TMDB S3E24 \"さくらと本当の想い\" (Sakura and her True Feelings); AniDB S4 \"ケロちゃんにおまかせ! Blu-ray BOXの巻\" (Episode S4) has no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E4 is \"Leave It to Kero!\", another item); AniDB S5 \"ケロちゃんにおまかせスペシャル\" (Episode S5) has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E5 is \"You're Wonderful, Sakura-chan! Tomoyo's Cardcaptor Sakura Video Diary Special!\", another item) and no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E5 is \"Prologue: Sakura and the Two Bears\", another item); AniDB S6-S7 (\"ケロちゃんにおまかせスペシャルDX[デラックス]\" (Episode S6) to \"ケロちゃんにおまかせスペシャルDX[デラックス]てんこもり\" (Episode S7)) have no TMDB episode (TMDB has none of them); AniDB S8 \"カードキャプター誕生(ケルベロス責任編集版)\" (Episode S8) is TVDB S0E9 and has no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E8); AniDB S9-S10 (\"カードキャプターさくらSPECIAL『クロウカード編』\" (Episode S9) to \"カードキャプターさくらSPECIAL『さくらカード編』\" (Episode S10)) have no TMDB episode (TMDB has none of them). TMDB S0E4 Leave It to Kero! is the theatrical short of node 514, and TVDB S0E9 カードキャプターさくら誕生 (ケルベロス責任編集版) carries S8's own subtitle.",
  "upstream": "https://github.com/Anime-Lists/anime-lists/pull/629",
